# The Windows launcher MUST keep CRLF: with LF endings cmd.exe cannot find its
# own labels and drops straight to the "no Python" branch. The shell launcher
# must stay LF for the same kind of reason.
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
